# AyanOS — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values.
# `.env.local` is git-ignored and must NOT be committed.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contact Form Endpoint (optional)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If set, the contact form POSTs JSON { name, email, message } to this URL.
# If left empty, the form falls back to a mailto: compose in the user's mail app.
#
# Recommended providers:
#   - Formspree:  https://formspree.io  (free tier available)
#   - Web3Forms:  https://web3forms.com
#   - Resend:     https://resend.com
#
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub Personal Access Token (optional)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unauthenticated GitHub API requests are rate-limited to 60/hour.
# Set a fine-grained PAT with "Public repositories (read)" scope to raise
# the limit to 5000/hour.
#
# VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here
